<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Best in Slot Gear list for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS in Cataclysm Classic Pre-Raid. <br/>Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Inferno Protocol Dungeons, Reputation and Professions.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">
<span class="c3">Best in Slot Gear for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS in Pre-Raid</span></h2>As a Beast Mastery Hunter your first set as always is reaching your hit cap. Luckily a lot of best in slot pre-raid gear has plenty of hit so you should have no issues at all reaching the hit cap of 961 rating. Also with Cataclysm and the reforging system it is easier than ever.<ol>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Hit Rating - You will want to aim for 8% hit rating, 961 rating as your first primary stat.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Agility - Agility is the next most important stat, and as a Hunter this will be the main base stat.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Critical Strike Rating - Crit Rating is your next most important secondary stat following hit cap.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Haste Rating and Mastery - These two stats share a somewhat similar value after Crit. Depending on your gear one might be slightly better or worse than the other.</div></li></ol>
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
