<br/>This gearset is similar in DPS to the previous set, however it doesn't require you to purchase BoEs and avoids the reputation farm with Avengers of Hyjal.<div class="clear"></div></div></div></div></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-beast-mastery-hunter-dps">Head for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h4>For the helm slot you have just one option, and that is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60303/lightning-charged-headguard">
<img alt="Lightning-Charged Headguard" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_mail_raidhunter_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightning-Charged Headguard</span></a>, as this will allow you to go for the set bonus. Though, before gaining enough <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69576/headdress-of-sharpened-vision">
<img alt="Headdress of Sharpened Vision" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_113.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Headdress of Sharpened Vision</span></a> is your best choice.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62369/arcanum-of-the-ramkahen">
<img alt="Arcanum of the Ramkahen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Ramkahen</span></a>
