<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-beast-mastery-hunter-dps">Shoulders for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h4>For the shoulders you ideally will want to aim for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60306/lightning-charged-spaulders">
<img alt="Lightning-Charged Spaulders" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_mail_raidhunter_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightning-Charged Spaulders</span></a>. They're cheap and it will help you get the T11 4-set bonus. On the flip side if you want to go for maximum item level, then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65074/spaulders-of-the-scarred-lady">
<img alt="Spaulders of the Scarred Lady" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_mail_raidhunter_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spaulders of the Scarred Lady</span></a> is more expensive, but offers higher stats.<br/>A good alternative before getting the fragments is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69554/pauldrons-of-nalorakk">
<img alt="Pauldrons of Nalorakk" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_85.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pauldrons of Nalorakk</span></a> because it carries both crit rating and a socket.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62346/greater-inscription-of-shattered-crystal">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Shattered Crystal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_goldendraenite_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Shattered Crystal</span></a>
