<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back-for-beast-mastery-hunter-dps">Back for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h4>Our best cloak right now is undoubtedly <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69884/mistral-drape">
<img alt="Mistral Drape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_melee_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mistral Drape</span></a> of the Windflurry, though <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71268/mantle-of-doubt">
<img alt="Mantle of Doubt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_firelands_fireset_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mantle of Doubt</span></a> is a very solid choice.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Cloak Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52777/enchant-cloak-greater-critical-strike">
