<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-beast-mastery-hunter-dps">Wrist for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h4>We're in a bit of a pickle with the Wrist slot. Our best option is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71264/bracers-of-forked-lightning">
<img alt="Bracers of Forked Lightning" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_mail_raidhunter_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of Forked Lightning</span></a>, but only if you purchase it off the Auction House. We want to save our <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> to purchase tier 12 as soon as possible, so your most realistic item is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65028/chimaeron-armguards">
<img alt="Chimaeron Armguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_mail_raidhunter_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chimaeron Armguards</span></a> which can easily be purchased by  <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68784/enchant-bracer-agility">
<img alt="Enchant Bracer - Agility" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Agility</span></a>
