<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist-for-beast-mastery-hunter-dps">Waist for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h4>For the belt slot you will want to aim for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71255/firearrow-belt">
<img alt="Firearrow Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_mail_raidhunter_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Firearrow Belt</span></a>. The stats on this belt are significantly better than any other options available and with the higher item level, it's a no brainer. It does require you to be Honored with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1204/avengers-of-hyjal">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Avengers of Hyjal</span></a> however, so you might want to go for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65368/star-chaser-belt">
<img alt="Star Chaser Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_mail_raidhunter_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Star Chaser Belt</span></a> of the Windflurry instead as that is much easier to obtain.<div class="pad"></div>
