<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-beast-mastery-hunter-dps">Legs for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h4>For the legs you have two solid options. If you want to go the absolute best option then you can purchase <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60230/twilight-scale-leggings">
<img alt="Twilight Scale Leggings" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pant_mail_raidhunter_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Twilight Scale Leggings</span></a>. It costs a lot more <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>, however it offers a significant upgrade over <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65378/star-chaser-legguards">
<img alt="Star Chaser Legguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pant_mail_raidhunter_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Star Chaser Legguards</span></a> of the Windflurry or any of its siblings.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Leg Armor:</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56550/dragonscale-leg-armor">
<img alt="Dragonscale Leg Armor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_monsterscales_14.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dragonscale Leg Armor</span></a>
