<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet-for-beast-mastery-hunter-dps">Feet for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h4>For the boots you have two options. For the absolute best gearset you will want to purchase <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70123/lancers-greaves">
<img alt="Lancer's Greaves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_chain_07.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lancer's Greaves</span></a> from the Molten Front<br/>
<br/>If you decide to go with an easier gearset option then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58199/moccasins-of-verdurous-glooms">
<img alt="Moccasins of Verdurous Glooms" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_mail_raidhunter_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Moccasins of Verdurous Glooms</span></a> as it's easy to farm and will be very cheap on the AH.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Feet Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52781/enchant-boots-assassins-step">
<img alt="Enchant Boots - Assassin's Step" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Assassin's Step</span></a>
