<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-beast-mastery-hunter-dps">Neck for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h4>For the neck slot you really only have one choice <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69880/mistral-pendant">
<img alt="Mistral Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownnecklaceb.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mistral Pendant</span></a> of the Windflurry. It's easy to farm with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> and perfectly matches our stat requirements.<br/>If you want to go for an alternative, then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69605/amulet-of-the-watcher">
<img alt="Amulet of the Watcher" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_zulgurub_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amulet of the Watcher</span></a> is also a solid choice.<div class="pad"></div>
