<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-beast-mastery-hunter-dps">Rings for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h4>For the rings you will want to use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65367/mistral-circle">
<img alt="Mistral Circle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rubystar.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mistral Circle</span></a> of the Windflurry and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70105/matoclaws-band">
<img alt="Matoclaw's Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Matoclaw's Band</span></a>.<br/>You have another option during the Halloween event <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71327/band-of-ghoulish-glee">
<img alt="Band of Ghoulish Glee" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bag_28_halloween.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of Ghoulish Glee</span></a> but really, you can't go wrong with any of the 365 item level rings available to us right now.<div class="pad"></div>
