<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-beast-mastery-hunter-dps">Trinkets for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h4>For the two trinkets you will want to aim for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65140/essence-of-the-cyclone">
<img alt="Essence of the Cyclone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cat_trinket01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Essence of the Cyclone</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58181/fluid-death">
<img alt="Fluid Death" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_vehicle_liquidpyrite_blue.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fluid Death</span></a>. These two trinkets should be relatively easy to obtain from Inferno Protocol dungeons.<br/>
<br/>You can go for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69001/ancient-petrified-seed">
<img alt="Ancient Petrified Seed" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_food_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ancient Petrified Seed</span></a>, however it requires you to farm reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1204/avengers-of-hyjal">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Avengers of Hyjal</span></a> in a raid group.<div class="pad"></div>
