<br/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="melee-weapons-for-beast-mastery-hunter-dps">Melee Weapons for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h4>As a <span class="c3">Beast Mastery Hunter</span> in Cataclysm you will typically want to always use a 2h weapon and ignore 1h options. The primary and secondary stats you gain from using a 2h weapon will <b>always</b> be better than using two 1h weapons.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70165/witch-hunters-harvester">
<img alt="Witch-Hunter's Harvester" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_polearm_2h_bwdraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Witch-Hunter's Harvester</span></a> is the absolute best option, and should not be terribly expensive to get crafted.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59474/malevolence">
<img alt="Malevolence" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stave_2h_grimbatolraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Malevolence</span></a> is the more realistic 2h option for pre-raid as it only requires 30 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68134/enchant-2h-weapon-mighty-agility">
<img alt="Enchant 2H Weapon - Mighty Agility" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant 2H Weapon - Mighty Agility</span></a>
