<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="ranged-weapon-for-beast-mastery-hunter-dps">Ranged Weapon for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h4>Finally for the ranged weapon and most important gear slot as a Hunter. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71077/extreme-impact-hole-puncher">
<img alt="Extreme-Impact Hole Puncher" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_rifle_44.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Extreme-Impact Hole Puncher</span></a> is the best option for a Beast Mastery Hunter for both absolute and realistic gearsets <b>except for trolls</b>.<br/>
<br/>As a Troll you will want to use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59320/themios-the-darkbringer">
<img alt="Themios the Darkbringer" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bow_1h_bwdraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Themios the Darkbringer</span></a> to take advantage of the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=26290/bow-specialization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_bow_12.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bow Specialization</span></a> racial.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Scope</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59594/gnomish-x-ray-scope">
<img alt="Gnomish X-Ray Scope" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_scopea.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gnomish X-Ray Scope</span></a>
